  m_text: "A face can carry its own material. The mesh then gets one material slot for each material it uses.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> You give the two walls one material and the floor another. How many material slots will the mesh have?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. In Face mode, select the floor and drag M_Kit_Ceramic-Tiles (the asset library's Materials/Kit folder) onto it.\n2. Select both walls and drag M_Kit_Concrete-Panels onto them.\n3. Check the Mesh Renderer.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Liminal-Kit 3 \xB7 Columns and furniture (Lamp post)</color></size>"
