  m_text: 'ProBuilder places each texture in metres: 1 UV unit = 1 m. The Kit materials are tiled to their real size on that basis.


    <b>Predict:</b> You make A twice as long with the Transform''s Scale, and B twice as long by moving its end face. On which wall do the bricks stretch?


    <b>Try:</b>

    1. Set A''s Scale X to 2.

    2. On B, select its end face (Face mode) and move it 1.6 m to the side.

    3. Compare the bricks.


    <size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Textures topic, Textured-Materials</color></size>'
