  m_text: "Smoothing groups decide which edges look soft. Faces in the same group are shaded as one curved surface; edges between groups stay sharp.\n\n<b>Predict:</b> This pillar has no smoothing. When you smooth its sides, which edges should still look sharp?\n\n<b>Try:</b>\n1. Select the side faces (Face mode).\n2. Open the Smoothing window and give them one group.\n3. Leave the top and bottom faces out.\n\n<size=85%><color=#A8A8A8>Reference: Liminal-Kit 3 \xB7 Columns and furniture (Round pillar)</color></size>"
